sections.text:
This tutorial is designed to accompany the AMBER ff15ipq-m force field for protein mimetics [
Bogetti et al. 2020
]. This tutorial will guide you through the process of building a short tetrapeptide using tleap, resources for modifying an existing protein, and visualization of the simulation results. AMBER ff15ipq-m files required for this tutorial are included in AmberTools 21, as well as in AmberTools 20 Update.10 and Update.14.
